  "description": {
   "en": "The strongest king in the city of delinquents. What he hates are mini-tomatoes and noisy women. His true identity is Jin Shiba, a detective of the detective agency “Hawk Eyes” who possesses the unusual ability of clairvoyance. Working with him are Rui Monokai, a recorder, and Kareyanagi Jedo. \n\n---\nNote: Based on the series of short animations on Youtube @hundrednote100, with each detective having their own channel."
  },
